Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.65,0:00:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.91,0:00:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the ancient magic\Nof my Orichalcos Tritos!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.95,0:00:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,When used properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.21,0:00:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the seal of Orichalcos is unmatched\Nby any other card in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And due to its third layer, your magic\Nand trap cards are useless against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Each layer of the seal is\Nmore powerful than the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't think of something soon,\NKaiba's going to lose the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, I'd like you to\Nmeet Orichalcos Shunaros!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see what I see? Unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ori-Kalcos-Shunaros!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.73,0:00:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove Kaiba's life points so the\NOri-Kalcos can remove his spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.47,0:00:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Photon ring blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.67,0:00:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ori-Kalcos-1, Seto-Kaiba, zip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.75,0:00:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate! Trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.05,0:01:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It converts every one of my dragon's\Nattack points into your life points, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.03,0:01:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll get what you deserve\Nwhen I feed your soul to the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.29,0:01:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,great leviathan and complete that\Nwhich I started centuries ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.87,0:01:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.23,0:02:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why you\Nwere sent here, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.45,0:02:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It was no fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Five thousand-year-old spirits\Ndon't suddenly return for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate brought you back so\Nyou could save the world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.61,0:02:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,by offering your power\Nto the great Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had some weird dreams,\Nbut this one takes the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember being trapped in a duel, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.47,0:02:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I end up floating around in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.19,0:03:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Bubble Boy, you call\Nthis all right? Hegesis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.15,0:03:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't escape soon, we never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.47,0:03:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where exactly are we, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, everyone in here\Nhad their soul captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be where the Orycalco\Nspits you out after you lose a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.71,0:03:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.97,0:03:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.65,0:03:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.29,0:03:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are about to get worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.59,0:03:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you pay attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the great Leviathan, and\Nit's using human souls for power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's doing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.65,0:03:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to be\Nturned into soul food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.69,0:03:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can still get out of this mess\Nif the pharaoh defeats darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But how's he going to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.23,0:03:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Rich boy's with us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:04:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That means the Pharaoh's facing\NDart alone out there. Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.17,0:04:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba may have been knocked out of the\Nfight, But the Pharaoh's not alone, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't follow, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still got all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.37,0:04:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, we're not right there next to him,\Nbut we've never let that stop us before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.73,0:04:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't know if\Nthat's going to work this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,because Darts is playing by\Na whole new set of rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.43,0:04:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And nothing can take\Ndown that Obelisk card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one thing that can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.53,0:04:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the card I gave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And if the pharaoh draws it, he'll be\Nable to unleash a force like no other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This card can beat dots?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.45,0:04:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.81,0:04:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,it was during a trip to Egypt that I was
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,inspired to create the\Ngame of dual monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,After making an astonishing discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.95,0:04:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient kings and sorcerers once performed\Ndark rituals to conjure real monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:05:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,These creatures were believed to have\Nlived in a universe parallel to ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And guarding the gateway\Nto this dominion of the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,beasts were three legendary\Ndragons known as Timaeus,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Critias, and Hermos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But you already know about them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What you don't know is that these\Ndragons aren't what they appear to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They were buried with a dark secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So I created a card that\Nunlocks this mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.71,0:05:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.83,0:05:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.51,0:05:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent many years\Nscouring the globe trying
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.11,0:05:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,to find an answer to that very question,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.37,0:05:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I searched the microscopic\Nworld for the tiniest clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.03,0:05:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I scanned the vast reaches\Nof the universe, and still nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.43,0:05:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than one stone tablet hidden\Ndeep beneath the sands of Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,there was no record of the\Nexistence of these dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it dawned on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.07,0:05:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What if these dragons\Naren't dragons at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What if they're humans? Humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But how is that possible, Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.55,0:06:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And what does it have to do with that\Nmystery card you gave to the Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.87,0:06:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,During the Battle of Atlantis,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.51,0:06:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts transformed three brave knights\Ninto dragons in an effort to weaken them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the Pharaoh must restore them to their
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.19,0:06:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,original form before we disappear forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see what's\Nhappening here, Darts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.71,0:06:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Orichalcos has corrupted your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.71,0:06:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been filling your head\Nwith lies for over 10,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You should talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.07,0:06:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been lying to the\Nworld for almost as long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to convince everyone that fate\Nsent you here to protect us from evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And you think that's a lie? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.05,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, your very heart\Nis filled with evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The same evil you claim to be fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:06:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, you represent the darkness\Nthat's inside all humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that, every one\Nof you must be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,For today, history repeats itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.97,0:07:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Battle of Atlantis\Nshall begin again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.61,0:07:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.15,0:07:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not another war!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.45,0:07:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.95,0:07:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.21,0:07:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.61,0:07:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's the case, Darts,\Nthen I'll end it here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.41,0:07:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.99,0:07:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll begin by\Nactivating my Pot of Greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me draw two more cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.51,0:07:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll summon my Obelisk\NCeltic Guardian to the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can do for now is try\Nmy best to avoid his attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,until I draw the right card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:07:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move, Darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I automatically get\Nanother 1,500 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.87,0:08:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there's my\NDexia's special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.23,0:08:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,which ensures that its\Nstrength is always 300
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.01,0:08:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,points higher than the\Nmonster it's attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So your only defense is\Nas good as gone, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.23,0:08:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving your life points\Nwide open for annihilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.11,0:08:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ori! Calcos! Dexia!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his obnoxious Celtic guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.77,0:08:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do now is give up half my\Nlife points, and my soul shield activates,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,blocking your attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.35,0:08:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, but what's the\Npoint? Just look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.01,0:09:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you you're all alone your\Nfriends are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.39,0:09:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,able to support you and\Nthe scoreboard doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.43,0:09:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,exactly point in your favor\Nnow does it so why drag
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.97,0:09:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,out this torment when\Nall you have to do is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Forfeit. Accept your destiny\Nand join your friends on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The other side. Maybe he's\Nright. He does have 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.39,0:09:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,000 life points and three\Nindestructible monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.15,0:09:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps i can do more for\Nmy friends by surrendering
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.39,0:09:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and allowing the ordy\Ncalcos to take me where
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,they are don't you want\Nto be by their side your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,friends are completely lost\Nwithout you don't turn away
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,all you have to do is\Nplace your hand over your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.17,0:09:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,dual disc and submit\Ndeclare defeat and you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Free to see your friends one last\Ntime before the rise of the beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.43,0:09:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,time you accepted your true destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've returned to Earth\Nto pay for the wrongs you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,once committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You nearly destroyed the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So in order to compensate for\Nthe misdeeds of your past,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you must join me in ushering\Nin the age of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.43,0:10:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender your spirit so\Nthat i may rebuild paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.55,0:10:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,just give up i must surrender\Nmy soul it's my fate
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.91,0:10:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,yes pharaoh keep listening to the voice
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,of reason inside your head i must give up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you're almost there give\Nin and join your friends
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.35,0:10:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It converts every one of my dragon's\Nattack points into your life points, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.07,0:10:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gone. Are you sure? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.65,0:10:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be right\Nthere by your side, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It only needs one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm letting the seal take me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.31,0:10:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.33,0:11:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacred Seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Encircle the Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the darkness consume you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Reach deep within your core\Nand set your spirit free.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can overcome the\Npower of the Orychalcos!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have lost the duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.19,0:12:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't the seal take your soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.11,0:12:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You forced me to gaze inside my heart,\Nthinking I would find only darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.71,0:12:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you gazed in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.81,0:12:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, believe what you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is filled with\Nthe light of friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and no magic can take that away, no\Nmatter how strong it is. So thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.35,0:12:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You reminded me that my\Nfriends are always with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.59,0:12:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and we're going to win this\Nfight and take you down together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.05,0:12:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts, it all ends right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.51,0:12:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the card Pegasus gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.77,0:12:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:13:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.21,0:13:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what's in my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to unlocking the secret\Nof the legendary dragons! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.91,0:13:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Legend of Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.47,0:13:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up 1,000 life points and remove my\Nobnoxious Celtic guardian from the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.71,0:13:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me summon Critias, Hermos,\Nand Timaeus in their true form!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.29,0:13:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, after ten millennia in\Ncaptivity, we've been set free!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.59,0:13:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.85,0:14:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I am he who was named Samaeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.87,0:14:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Critias!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.85,0:14:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I am known as...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Hennemont!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.11,0:14:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the name of Atlantis,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I took care\Nof you centuries ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My precious seal is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ring of darkness is\Nuseless in our presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.97,0:14:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget our last encounter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.69,0:14:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.55,0:14:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have a score to settle with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.03,0:15:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to weaken your defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomaeus, attack his Orichalcus Aristeros!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.59,0:15:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done. Now Critias,\NHermos, it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that I shall end my turn
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.65,0:15:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Orichalco Shuneros Attack\NCritias With photon ring blast
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.09,0:15:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Critias, defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.43,0:15:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attack won't work, thanks\Nto his special ability. His what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He can bring back one trap card, and I\Nchoose the reflecting power of Mirror Force
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.59,0:16:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Critias can stop\Nyour attack and send it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,right back at your monsters\NOh no I'm afraid so
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent move, Pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.97,0:16:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, did I mention Shunaros\Nhas a special ability as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.43,0:16:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.03,0:16:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment Shunaros was vanquished,\Nmy divine serpent was born!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, there's a price to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.35,0:16:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I must send every card\Nin my hand to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.61,0:16:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, I'm required to give up\Nevery one of my life points. Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.01,0:17:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.09,0:17:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Under normal conditions, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.57,0:17:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,However, as long as my divine serpent\Nis on the field, I remain in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you destroy him, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,His strength, it's infinite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.57,0:17:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means there's not a monster in\Nyour deck that can stand up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.59,0:17:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And once it strikes your\Nnight, your soul is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.33,0:17:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Staring at your deck won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to actually play something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.67,0:17:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.49,0:17:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark magician girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.65,0:17:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, both of our\Nworlds are in great danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.81,0:17:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,For soon the great beast will awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.05,0:17:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.87,0:17:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I made you a promise, and\NI won't go back on my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.07,0:18:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.43,0:18:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.69,0:18:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I discard ten cards from my\Ndeck so my new monster can attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine Serpent, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike down one of his knights!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tobias, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.43,0:18:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there were two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.01,0:18:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, you just\Nlost the rest of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.91,0:18:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So the duel is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.91,0:18:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As is your existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.17,0:18:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So fare thee well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.01,0:18:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how did you survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.91,0:18:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.07,0:18:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me to play a card, so I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.09,0:19:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a powerful trap known as Relay Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.25,0:19:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,When my life points hit zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.09,0:19:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,it allowed me to stay in\Nthe game by summoning my
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,dark magician girl and\Nputting my fate in her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So you and I are in\Nthe same situation now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of us has one monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.43,0:19:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You have your serpent, and\NI have Dark Magician Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.39,0:19:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When one is destroyed,\Nthe cardholder will lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the final phase begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but understand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have altered\Nthe rules of our battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.81,0:19:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but your chances of\Nvictory are just as slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.31,0:19:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the spirits of my\Nfriends to support me, Darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.25,0:19:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But you, on the other\Nhand, are completely alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.65,0:19:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I possess more power\Nthan you or your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.45,0:19:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll prove it by playing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.49,0:19:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Impact Revive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:20:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It brings back a monster\Nthat was destroyed this turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And gives it an extra 500 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.57,0:20:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my card.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.05,0:20:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you revive Tomaeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.93,0:20:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be fun to prove\Nhow powerless you truly are. Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.99,0:20:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and one more thing Impact Revive also\Nlets my monster attack one more time
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.71,0:20:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I send ten cards from\Nmy deck to my graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.53,0:20:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Divine Serpent, end this duel
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,His soul is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.35,0:20:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's destroyed, all hope is lost.
